        rdfs:comment                   "The ground of light neutral tan is covered with zig-zag lines of red of fancy weave; fine black lines emphasize the zig-zags.  The design of waving lines bearing hunches of flowers, is woven with light neutral tan color and dull pink, green, black and cream colored silk."@en ;
